==============================================================================
                            DATA FLOW SUMMARY
==============================================================================

Mission Execution Flow:
1. Ground Control → Mission Upload → UAV Flight Controller
2. UAV → Navigate to Waypoint → Position Hold
3. ESP32 → Activate Pump → Collect Sample
4. Sensors → Read Values → ESP32 Processing
5. ESP32 → LoRa Transmission → Ground Station
6. ESP32 → Log to microSD → Local Storage
7. UAV → Return to Home → Land and Disarm
8. Ground Station → Download Data → Analysis

Real-time Telemetry:
- Frequency: Every 5-10 seconds
- Packet Size: ~80 bytes
- Data: pH, Turbidity, Temp, GPS, Status
- Protocol: Custom ASCII/Binary over LoRa
- Latency: <200ms one-way

==============================================================================
                        COMPONENT SPECIFICATIONS
==============================================================================

WEIGHT BREAKDOWN:
- Mechanical System: 800g
- Electronics & Sensors: 400g
- Sample (full): 1000g
- Total Loaded: 2200g

POWER BUDGET:
- ESP32 System: 500mA @ 3.3V = 1.65W
- Sensors: 200mA @ 5V = 1.0W
- Pump (active): 1000mA @ 12V = 12W
- GPS + LoRa: 300mA @ 5V = 1.5W
- Total (sampling): ~16W
- Total (idle): ~4W

OPERATIONAL PARAMETERS:
- Operating Temp: 0-40°C
- Storage Temp: -20 to +60°C
- Humidity: 0-95% RH (non-condensing)
- Altitude: 0-1000m AMSL
- Mission Duration: 15-20 minutes
- Sample Volume: Up to 1000mL
- Sampling Depth: 0.3-1.0m below surface

==============================================================================

To generate actual PNG diagram:
1. Use Lucidchart, draw.io, or Visio
2. Import this structure
3. Add colors, icons, and styling
4. Export as high-resolution PNG (300 DPI minimum)
5. Save to this location

Recommended diagram software:
- draw.io (free, web-based)
- Lucidchart (professional)
- Microsoft Visio (enterprise)
- Inkscape (open-source SVG)

